  "about": {
    "title": "About the EX Dragon set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: EX Dragon is a EX expansion released on 24 November 2003. It has 100 cards: 97 in the main set and 3 secret rares. There are also 88 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 97 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (185 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 188 cards, adding the 3 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
